{
  "note": "意图确认（B-4 卡验收第 4 条）：玩家说「身代わりになる」→ 提取出一个让玩家自己去当人质的候选（改 var.hostage.who、var.player.custody，不可逆），needsConfirm，人物这一轮没在反问（asked: false），由服务端另起一轮问出 question；说「代わりに残る」→ 同样的候选，人物这一轮已经在反问（asked: true），直接推 confirm。草稿开着、对着反问的人物说「本気」→ confirmAnswer: yes；说「やめておく」→ no。卡上写的是「人質」，评测用例里玩家常说这个词（E-0 的快照会变），换成这几个说法。话都是为测试写的。",
  "rules": [
    {
      "kind": "extract",
      "when": {
        "playerContains": "身代わりになる"
      },
      "output": {
        "candidates": [
          {
            "actor": "player",
            "type": "say",
            "origin": "turn",
            "summary": "旅人は、メロスに代わって人質になると申し出た",
            "causes": [],
            "effects": [
              {
                "op": "set",
                "var": "var.hostage.who",
                "value": "player"
              },
              {
                "op": "set",
                "var": "var.player.custody",
                "value": "hostage"
              }
            ],
            "needsConfirm": true,
            "asked": false,
            "question": "……君が、私の代わりに人質になるというのか。"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "extract",
      "when": {
        "playerContains": "代わりに残る"
      },
      "output": {
        "candidates": [
          {
            "actor": "player",
            "type": "say",
            "origin": "turn",
            "summary": "旅人は、人質として町にとどまると申し出た",
            "causes": [],
            "effects": [
              {
                "op": "set",
                "var": "var.hostage.who",
                "value": "player"
              },
              {
                "op": "set",
                "var": "var.player.custody",
                "value": "hostage"
              }
            ],
            "needsConfirm": true,
            "asked": true,
            "question": "……本気で言っているのか。"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "extract",
      "when": {
        "confirmOpen": true,
        "playerContains": "本気"
      },
      "output": {
        "candidates": [],
        "confirmAnswer": "yes"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "extract",
      "when": {
        "confirmOpen": true,
        "playerContains": "やめておく"
      },
      "output": {
        "candidates": [],
        "confirmAnswer": "no"
      }
    }
  ]
}
